    "Fresh-definition restore matches complete checkpoint and next command state/events; rejection preserves input.",
    "Independent predecessor/current fixtures; migration verifies old checksum before restoring under the selected profile.",
    "Required/null/unknown/duplicate fields, versions, checksum, bounded input and cross-field IDs/equipment/ownership/summary validated before publication.",
    "Whitelisted slots, validated catalog metadata, expected-content revisions, busy locks and two competing writers.",
    "Serialization and injected create/access/flush/promotion failures preserve live state and previous files; temporary files cleaned.",
    "Actual Windows delete-sharing failure blocks replacement and preserves the prior save.",
    "Canceled/failed load preserves live state; explicit validated backup load leaves damaged primary intact; recovered state saves to a new slot."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "All campaign definitions and travel rules are invented; no original campaign, date advancement, encounter or RNG continuation claim.",
    "One application owner serializes live-session commands; per-slot locks coordinate cooperating store instances.",
    "Revision tokens hash file content; identical rewrites have the same token.",
    "Local Windows flush/promotion and tested failure paths are not a power-loss, adversarial-filesystem or remote-filesystem proof.",
